# Candela dataset {{ m.version }} — data card

Generated {{ m.createdAt }} by `lab data build --version {{ m.version }}` from `ml/{{ m.config }}` (config hash `{{ m.configHash }}`, seed {{ m.seed }}). The manifest with file hashes is `ml/manifests/{{ m.version }}.json`.

## Purpose

Supervised fine-tuning data for the Candela equity-research assistant: grounded tool use over the Candela market tools, agentic finance answers, general function calling, numeric reasoning over filings, short classic finance tasks in the Candela voice, and a general-retention slice against forgetting.

One sample is **one supervised assistant turn with its full conversation prefix** (only the final assistant message is trained on). Samples longer than {{ m.maxTokens }} tokens with the `{{ m.tokenizer }}` chat template are dropped.

